# The released images this repository depends on, and nothing else (viafrei-web#2).
# One line per pin: <key> <image>:<X.Y.Z>@sha256:<digest>. The digest is what is
# pulled; the version tag is what a reader sees, and `scripts/pins.sh check` holds
# the two equal against the registry. A bump is a one-line change here.
#
#   digest    the viafrei-app image whose digest service renders the fragments the
#             shell embeds (/internal/…): the e2e harness runs its compiled digest,
#             ingest and mcp packages (scripts/pinned-app.sh), and the integration
#             run starts its digest service (scripts/stack.sh). It is the image
#             prod's digest Deployment runs (read 2026-11-15).
#   database  the viafrei-database release that migrates the digest's database in
#             the integration run (scripts/stack.sh, the compose `migrate` service). Schema head 306,
#             the release viafrei-app 2.6.23 is pinned to.
#   api       the viafrei-api release the site's API client targets: packages/web/src/api/contract.ts is
#             generated from its api/openapi.json at the same tag (scripts/api-contract.mjs), and a test
#             holds the two versions equal. The digest is the one the release page names.
#   carry     an earlier image whose packages/web/dist/client/_a/ files the release build
#             carries for 14 days (viafrei-web#36; scripts/carry-previous.sh, release.yml).
#             Repeatable. viafrei-app 2.6.23 is the image prod serves the site from until
#             this repository's image replaces it; each later release adds the one before it.
digest ghcr.io/mavrovde/viafrei-app:2.6.23@sha256:5eb75758c223d6e9a2bbd2b66ecba397f8594eceee91cdfab34a7965b2467968
database ghcr.io/mavrovde/viafrei-database:0.2.0@sha256:98f0e01b8bb2f34afac8b482bd701ee61fa7bf142cc03d413e83c3b8b605ec9f
api ghcr.io/mavrovde/viafrei-api:0.3.2@sha256:2501a51df78e0f071588eb8c73732f1bb5aee1fb80ff0e66ab408f99f3e109ac
carry ghcr.io/mavrovde/viafrei-app:2.6.23@sha256:5eb75758c223d6e9a2bbd2b66ecba397f8594eceee91cdfab34a7965b2467968
